   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPP DPG HEALTH SECRETARIAT FOR TROIKA TO SUSTAIN THE PRIORITIES OF DPG THROUGH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Title: Support to the DPG Health Secreatariat. The DPG-Health is a group of 22 development partners (bi-lateral and multi-lateral) supporting the health sector in Tanzania. It is among the 16 different working groups and sectors of the Development Partners Group (DPG-Main). The DPG-Health supports the Government of Tanzania in improving the health and well-being of all Tanzanians and promotes coordination among Development Partners for the most effective use of Development Partners resources. The DPG Health is supported by a secretariat housed in the World Health Organisation</narrative>
  </description>
